&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-36f618bc-2c80-80e7-a04a-001cc06a8d28 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Senior Data Analyst to lead data quality, maintenance, and data import processes while helping advance the organization’s analytics capability. You will take ownership of SPARETECH&#39;s heart—the Golden Layer—by acquiring, importing, and maintaining spare parts product data to increase its value. You will ensure data accuracy and integrity, design and lead reporting and analytics frameworks, and deliver actionable insights to support business decision-making.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you the opportunity to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the acquisition, import, and maintenance of product data in SPARETECH&#39;s proprietary database while ensuring accuracy and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough quality checks on incoming catalogues and ensure high database integrity by investigating and resolving reported product issues in collaboration with the Data and Partner Management teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively across teams to gather business requirements and lead the development of core data reporting and analytics that drive better decision-making throughout the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of Product Data Management and Data Acquisition topics, constantly seeking opportunities to improve and optimize our existing structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become a part of our team if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in data analysis, data management, or business intelligence roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing analytics functions or data capabilities within a growing organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing data quality checks and governance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and advanced Excel skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python or R for data analysis and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with relational databases, non-relational databases and Metabase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data processing techniques and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring junior analysts and promote a data-driven culture across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-yes company, where you can decide every day whether you work from home, at our Stuttgart or Munich office, or at any&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.designoffices.de/&quot;&gt;Design Office&lt;/a&gt; in Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A permanent employment contract, 30 days of vacation, and the opportunity to participate in the company&#39;s success through our VSOP program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern hardware and the frame for a height-adjustable desk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual training budget of 1000 EURO for your professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In Germany: A subsidized&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://www.jobrad.org/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id--1644864965&quot;&gt;job bike&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to escape city traffic and a&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://qualitrain.net/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1677192227&quot;&gt;Wellpass&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; gym membership to stay active.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic start-up atmosphere and an international team in which new ideas, creative approaches, and cooperation at eye level are valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To enjoy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.corporate-benefits.de/&quot;&gt;Corporate Benefits&lt;/a&gt;, including discounts on fashion, travel, and much more from various companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SPARETECH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SPARETECH&#39;s vision is to empower the zero-waste industrial sharing economy by enabling maintenance and procurement teams at manufacturing leaders like Bosch, Porsche, and Nestlé to reduce MRO spend and optimize inventory through accurate part information, internal transparency, and market visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve this, we have built, and continue to build, an AI-powered MRO software that connects all players in the spare parts ecosystem, from manufacturers and suppliers to the people working behind the machines. By facilitating the exchange of data, knowledge, and expertise, we create shared visibility that empowers smarter decisions, reduces waste, and drives seamless collaboration. This connected spare parts intelligence unlocks value that extends far beyond software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://www.thesaasnews.com/news/sparetech-raises-10-million-in-series-a&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1257119756&quot;&gt;Insight Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, SPARETECH is accelerating its growth with a strong focus on product innovation and team excellence. We take pride in our inclusive and collaborative culture, as well as our energetic and committed team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, keeping our platform safe and compliant is critical to the trust of the millions of small businesses we serve around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join our Global AML team at an exciting point in its growth. We’re expanding into new markets, evolving our AML capabilities, introducing AI-enabled controls, and navigating increasingly complex regulatory expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an AML Data Analyst, you’ll play a key role in turning AML data into actionable insights. Working closely with our global AML Operations and AML Governance teams, as well as colleagues across Engineering and Data, you’ll help us understand how our controls are performing, identify risks and gaps early, and make better decisions as our business scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role where your analysis will go beyond reporting. The insights you generate will directly support how we monitor, improve, and strengthen our global AML framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain AML dashboards, operational reports, and data packs used by AML Operations, AML Governance, and senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design measurement frameworks that track AML operational KPIs, including case volumes, productivity, SLA adherence, and screening hit rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support AML teams by providing data extracts, analysis, trend identification, and root-cause analysis on AML control outputs and data quality issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run data validation and quality checks to keep AML data accurate and consistent across systems and regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Transaction Monitoring and Sanctions/PEP screening through data analysis, requirements definition, and testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering and AML Operations to define data requirements and support automation projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build self-service analytics resources so AML Operations teams can explore data and find insights independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be great for this role if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in data analytics, business intelligence, or a similar role within financial services, fintech, compliance, AML, or another regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills, including writing complex queries and building reliable datasets for reporting and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with Python for data analysis and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with a cloud data warehouse such as Snowflake.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to identify patterns, trends, root causes, and actionable insights from complex data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate technical analysis into clear recommendations and stories for non-technical stakeholders and senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data quality, validation, multiple data sources, and competing stakeholder priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, curious mindset and interest in AML, financial crime, fintech, and emerging technologies such as AI, with the ability to take ownership in a fast-changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧑‍🔬 We take learning and experimentation seriously with Hack Days every second Friday, and entire &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FBKiVCLompk&quot;&gt;global Hack Weeks&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: Be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2,000 for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our VSOP program: You will own a stake in SumUp’s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔄 30 Days Sabbatical: Enjoy the unique opportunity to take a well-deserved break with our 30 days sabbatical benefit after completing 3 years of employment with SumUp&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: Earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚵🏾‍♂️ Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, relocation assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SumUp is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer that proudly pursues and hires a diverse workforce. SumUp does not make hiring or employment decisions on the basis of race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by Company policy. SumUp also strives for a healthy and safe workplace and strictly prohibits harassment of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 36 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in our diverse team of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore career opportunities with us and join a team driven by collaboration, innovation, and a shared vision of creating a world where everyone can build a thriving business. Discover more about our vibrant and inclusive work culture and how we work on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fondée en 2014, Artefact est une société française de services autour de la data, spécialisée dans le conseil en IA, transformation data et en data &amp;amp; digital marketing. L’approche unique d’Artefact, qui fait le pont entre la donnée et le business, permet à nos clients d’atteindre leurs objectifs business de façon dédiée et efficace. Nos 2500 collaborateurs répartis dans 27 bureaux à travers le monde allient leurs compétences pluridisciplinaires au profit de l’innovation business des entreprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La mission des Artefactors ? Transformer la data de nos clients en impact business. Dans ce sens, nous collaborons avec plus de 1000 clients, leaders de leurs industries (Orange, Carrefour, Samsung, AccorHotels, L’Oréal, LVMH, Decathlon) et sommes partenaires privilégiés de Google (GMP/GCP), AWS ainsi que Microsoft Azure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;929&quot; data-end=&quot;1135&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En tant que stagiaire Data Analyst,&lt;/strong&gt; tu seras intégré(e) à une équipe travaillant étroitement avec des consultants / data scientists et tu participeras à des missions ayant un impact réel pour les clients. Tes missions pourront inclure :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;2064&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;Collecter, nettoyer, préparer les données à partir de sources diverses (bases de données internes, API, logs, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;Explorer et analyser les données pour identifier tendances, anomalies, corrélations, patterns utiles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1364&quot; data-end=&quot;1570&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1366&quot; data-end=&quot;1570&quot;&gt;Participer à la conception et réalisation de dashboards / reportings sous outils de data visualisation (ex. Tableau, PowerBI, ou outils internes) pour présenter les résultats aux équipes ou aux clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1571&quot; data-end=&quot;1647&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1573&quot; data-end=&quot;1647&quot;&gt;Contribuer à la définition de KPI pertinents selon les objectifs métier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1648&quot; data-end=&quot;1818&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1650&quot; data-end=&quot;1818&quot;&gt;Travailler en collaboration avec les équipes métier (marketing, produit, etc.) pour bien comprendre leurs besoins et transformer ces besoins en analyses exploitables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1895&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1821&quot; data-end=&quot;1895&quot;&gt;Aider à automatiser certains processus de reporting ou analyses simples.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1896&quot; data-end=&quot;2064&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1898&quot; data-end=&quot;2064&quot;&gt;Documenter tes travaux, partager les résultats et les apprentissages au sein de l’équipe, proposer des améliorations ou de nouvelles approches quand c’est possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2111&quot; data-end=&quot;2304&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2111&quot; data-end=&quot;2304&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Étudiant(e) en dernière année de cycle ingénieur, Master 2, ou équivalent, avec une spécialisation en Data, Intelligence Artificielle, Mathématiques appliquées, Statistiques ou Informatique et recherche un stage de fin d&#39;études à partir de Janvier 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2337&quot; data-end=&quot;2892&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2337&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2339&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;Maîtrise de &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2351&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; pour extraire / manipuler les données.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2400&quot; data-end=&quot;2523&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2402&quot; data-end=&quot;2523&quot;&gt;Connaissances en langage de programmation pour l’analyse de données, typiquement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2483&quot; data-end=&quot;2493&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; (avec pandas, numpy, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2524&quot; data-end=&quot;2646&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2526&quot; data-end=&quot;2646&quot;&gt;Bonne compréhension des principes statistiques de base (moyennes, distributions, tests, corrélations, variance, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2647&quot; data-end=&quot;2740&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2649&quot; data-end=&quot;2740&quot;&gt;Capacité à créer des visualisations / dashboards (Tableau, PowerBI, ou outil équivalent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2741&quot; data-end=&quot;2892&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2743&quot; data-end=&quot;2892&quot;&gt;Connaissance minimale de l’écosystème numérique et data (web analytics, datalake, dataviz, etc.) est un plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2894&quot; data-end=&quot;2940&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2894&quot; data-end=&quot;2938&quot;&gt;Compétences personnelles / soft skills :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2941&quot; data-end=&quot;3489&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2941&quot; data-end=&quot;2991&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2943&quot; data-end=&quot;2991&quot;&gt;Esprit logique et analytique, souci du détail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2992&quot; data-end=&quot;3088&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2994&quot; data-end=&quot;3088&quot;&gt;Sens de la communication orale et écrite : savoir expliquer ses résultats à des non-experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3089&quot; data-end=&quot;3171&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3091&quot; data-end=&quot;3171&quot;&gt;Capacité à travailler en équipe, à écouter et à comprendre les besoins métier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3172&quot; data-end=&quot;3260&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3174&quot; data-end=&quot;3260&quot;&gt;Proactivité, curiosité, et capacité à proposer des idées ou des approches nouvelles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3261&quot; data-end=&quot;3328&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3263&quot; data-end=&quot;3328&quot;&gt;Autonomie, tout en étant à l’aise avec le suivi et les retours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3329&quot; data-end=&quot;3489&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3331&quot; data-end=&quot;3489&quot;&gt;Bon niveau en français (oral et écrit) ; l’anglais professionnel est un plus, notamment pour échanges ou documentations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un stage de &lt;strong&gt;6 mois&lt;/strong&gt; basé à &lt;strong&gt;Paris&lt;/strong&gt; dans le 9ème arrondissement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un accompagnement par un tuteur expérimenté et l&#39;opportunité de travailler avec des équipes reconnues&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La possibilité d&#39;être embauché(e) en CDI à l&#39;issue du stage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Socle de formation (training day, Retex, café tech) développement des compétences via des outils internes innovants&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prêt à rejoindre l&#39;aventure ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si tu te reconnais dans cette description et que tu souhaites mettre tes compétences au service de projets concrets et impactants, envoie-nous ta candidature !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quels que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>
